  "blocked": "Needs p1-ingredient-catalog-step1-unified-resolver merged first (resolve() and catalog ids); ideally also step 2, so the runtime LLM fallback only sees the long tail. \
Owner decision also needed: when the write-time LLM call fails (OpenRouter down or invalid response), should the recipe save abort (strict fail-fast), or should resolution run as a visible, retryable job step after the save, like the existing enrich_* steps? \
A silent fallback to unknown is not an option.",
